<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH CUP AND LEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH CUP AND LEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of English cup and league</p>
<p>matches on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Division one</p>
<p> Charlton	    1 Grimsby	   3</p>
<p> Reading	     0 Birmingham	0</p>
<p> Sheffield United  2 Swindon	   0</p>
<p>Division three</p>
<p> Chester	     0 Cardiff	   1</p>
<p>League Cup fourth round</p>
<p> Ipswich	     1 Gillingham	0</p>
<p> Oxford		1 Southampton     1</p>
<p> Wimbledon	   1 Aston Villa     0</p>
<p>F.A. Challenge Cup first round replays:</p>
<p> Barnet	   1    Farnborough     0</p>
<p> Brighton	 1    Sudbury	   1</p>
<p>(Sudbury won 4-3 on penalties)</p>
<p> Bristol City   1    Swansea	   0</p>
<p> Hayes	    0    Stevenage	 2</p>
<p> Hull	     8    Whitby Town     4</p>
<p> Millwall	 0    Woking	    1</p>
<p> Rushden	  2    Boreham Wood    3</p>
<p> Scarborough    1    Shrewsbury	0</p>
<p> Walsall	  3    Northwich	 1</p>
<p> Wrexham	  2    Colwyn Bay	0</p>
<p> York	     3    Hartlepool	0</p>
</text>
